{#
  templates/openbao-raft-snapshot.timer.j2 — systemd timer for the nightly
  OpenBao Raft snapshot job (PRIMARY only). Rendered by openbao_install /
  task 11.1 onto {{ openbao_backup_systemd_dir }}/{{ openbao_backup_service_name }}.timer.

  Fires at 02:00 UTC nightly (Req 11.1). The explicit UTC in OnCalendar pins the
