  Persistent=true so a run missed while the host was off fires on next boot
  rather than silently skipping a night's backup.

  Contract asserted by the task-11.1 offline structural test:
    * OnCalendar = {{ openbao_backup_oncalendar }} (02:00 UTC nightly);
    * Persistent = {{ openbao_backup_persistent | lower }}.
